descriptionSummary":"Provident es la empresa líder de préstamos personales en México. Desde el año 2003, la compañía lleva servicios financieros oportunos, responsables y transparentes, principalmente a la población aún no bancarizada, contribuyendo a la inclusión financiera en el país. Con el reto de impulsar el crecimiento y llevar mejores servicios a los clientes, en 2017 la empresa implementó la estrategia para trasladar sus aplicaciones a la nube.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/provident_logo%401x.7927105c31103fe51f0690a26d33cfa58b7a6f38.png","displayLocation":"México","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios financieros","sortDate":"2020-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/provident/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Historia del cliente","customer-name":"Provident","headline":"Cambio a la nube AWS hace Provident más ágil y competitiva"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#chime","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Chime","description":"Amazon Chime","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:20+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#central-america","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Central America","description":"Central America","dateCreated":"2021-02-19T05:32:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-r