 Services (AWS) to help enhance the experience of guests as it looks to scale operations. By running in the AWS Cloud, Melco\u0027s casino management system setup time has gone from 9 months to just 4 weeks.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/melco-logo@1x.cca8157d73483beaccbc67b735696678215f7e33.png","displayLocation":"Hong Kong","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Travel \u0026 Hospitality","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/melco-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Melco Resorts \u0026 Entertainment","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Melco Resorts \u0026 Entertainment Enhances Guest Experience on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#websites-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Websites \u0026 Web Apps","description":"Websites \u0026 Web Apps","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:28:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:36:00+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#websites-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Websites \u0026 Apps","description":"Websites \u0026 Apps","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-05T03:54:13+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#customer-engagement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Customer Engagement","description":"Customer Engagement","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-21T2