6-01T23:08:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:37+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Para seguir llevando la calidad y disponibilidad de sus servicios para más de 5,200 clientes, Grupo Tress Internacional migró de una infraestructura on-premises hacia nube privada y, más tarde, hacia nube pública de Amazon Web Services. Como resultado, Grupo Tress sumó mucho más valor a las soluciones y servicios que ofrece al mercado, además de crear una gran cercanía física y digital con sus clientes.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/grupotress_logo%401x.45ebe70b59c8249548e37bc666e15f3f11c8b671.png","displayLocation":"México","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Fabricación","sortDate":"2020-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/gtimexico/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Historia del cliente","customer-name":"Grupo Tress Internacional","headline":"Grupo Tress Internacional garantiza continuidad del negocio y eficiencia de costos con AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#waf","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS WAF","description":"AWS WAF","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#business-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:22:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"i