#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#netflix-kubernetes-reinvent2020-video","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"netflix-kubernetes-reinvent2020-video","dateCreated":"2022-10-18T21:00:13+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-19T03:04:57+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"In this session, Netflix shares some lessons learned in its multi-year journey building the ML systems that Metaflow incorporates, covering a diverse range of scale from one-time experimentation on laptops to large-scale model training and serving systems on AWS.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Netflix_1x.4ae5e442fea7c25ec27b81891425de0b830cbfcc.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"netflix","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/netflix-kubernetes-reinvent2020-video/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Netflix","publishedDate":"2020","enableShare":"1","headline":"Simplifying Delivery as Code with Spinnaker and Kubernetes","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#media-entertainment","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","description":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#innovator","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Innovator","description":"Innovator","dateCreated":"2022-04-05T21:17:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-06-27T20:43:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video