 algunos años, con el crecimiento del negocio, Toracom conoció la arquitectura sin servidores. Desde 2018, la compañía se inclinó por la parte de serverless applications y desde entonces lo que hace con los clientes es automáticamente autoescalable, muy seguro y flexible.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/Latam%20Cases%20Assets/ToraCom_LOGO_NEW_2.72924770cbb088419869d538ca764665566cf58c.png","displayLocation":"México","customerNameLower":"toracom","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Software e Internet","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/toracom/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Toracom","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"Toracom aumenta facturación un 200% con servicios de IoT e AI con AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:23+0000","dateUpd