"GLOBAL#workload#microsoft","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#workload","name":"Microsoft","description":"Microsoft","dateCreated":"2021-01-06T00:09:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:36:04+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#sacde","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"sacde","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:06:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:39+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"SACDE es una empresa de construcción, actualmente con obras en las principales provincias argentinas. Su equipo de tecnología está centralizado en la capital federal, y en cada obra de cada provincia SACDE cuenta con un referente técnico.\n\n En su estrategia de cambio digital, SACDE trabaja con una implementación de SAP S/4 Hana y un programa de implementaciones con búsqueda en lo que es la automatización, digitalización, implementación de IoT y otras soluciones que buscan que el negocio pueda trabajar distinto en el día a día en cada obra y proyecto. Para esto, SACDE cuenta con instancias Amazon Elastic compute Cloud, Amazon Simple Storage Service, Amazon S3 Glacier y Amazon Route 53 para la resolución de DNS. En esta transición a la nube, la compañía trabaja con el apoyo del socio de negocios APN Escala 24/7.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/sacde_logo%401x.c2c35cd23fe3bb6945001180ff89921c36d45431.png","displayLocation":"Argentina","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Bienes inmuebles y construcción","sortDate":"2020-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/sacde/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Historia del cliente","customer-name":"SACDE","headline":"SACDE moderniza sus operaciones con apoyo de la nube de AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#workload#sap","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#workload","name":"SAP","description":"SAP","dateCreated":"2021-01-06T00:09:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:36:05+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#construction-real-estate","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Construction \u0026 Real Estate","description":"Construction \u0026 Real Estate","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:03:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:00+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#argentina","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Argentina","description":"Argentina","dateCreated":"2020-06-12T23:30:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#business-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:22:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#business-applications-sap","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Business Applications: SAP","description":"Business Applications: SAP","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#knotion","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"knotion","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:10:53+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:34+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Usando Amazon Web Services (AWS), Knotion escala sin problemas para distribuir contenido de manera confiable a 50,000 estudiantes en 150 escuelas. Knotion, una EdTech con sede en México, proporciona sistemas de aprendizaje para escuelas con contenido transdisciplinario para estudiantes. Su misión es lograr un impacto positivo en el mundo al proporcionar a los estudiantes contenido alineado con los Objetivos Sostenibles de las Naciones Unidas hacia 2030. Knotion ejecuta su infraestructura en AWS utilizando rds (Amazon RDS), Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3), y AWS Elastic Beanstalk.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/Latam%20Cases%20Assets/knotion_logo.5235932caef09958740b24f7343e51d5c200b2cf.png","displayLocation":"México","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Software e Internet","sortDate":"2020-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/knotion/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Historia del cliente","customer-name":"Knotion","headline":"Knotion escala para llegar a 50,000 estudiantes usando AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"