ces","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:08+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#fleet-management","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"fleet-management","dateCreated":"2020-11-24T23:39:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-09-09T00:34:16+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"With AWS\u0027s integration capabilities and serverless tools, Fleet Management Limited is able to build a serverless architecture on AWS cloud with impoved data resiliency and accelerated global performance on application uptime.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/FLEET_logo@1x.e4ae8880d72a13d254328cad33699a5ec5dd82a4.png","displayLocation":"Hong Kong","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Transport \u0026 Logistics","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/fleet-management/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u