-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#sony-2020-reinvent-video","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"sony-2020-reinvent-video","dateCreated":"2022-07-18T22:33:13+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-19T03:04:50+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eSony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) Worldwide Studios is a diverse network of highly successful and passionate game development studios and support functions, responsible for creating some of the world\u0026rsquo;s most well-known PlayStation games. In this session, SIE Cloud Infrastructure Project Manager Asghar Nisar and Engineer Andy Taylor share how SIE is modernizing its existing infrastructure to remotely render visual images and effects using AWS.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-customer-content/sony_playstation_studios_logo_v2.a812bed906aaad714c066f7794a1ce95586e2b69.png","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/sony-playstation-logo%401x.0960d0012cfb7f230e4c703786dec7201ae056f6.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"sony interactive entertainment","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eModernizing infrastructure to remotely render visual images and effects\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Gaming","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/sony-2020-reinvent-video/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Sony Interactive Entertainment","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"How Sony Interactive Entertainment renders with AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022