e unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#dtek-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"dtek-case-study","dateCreated":"2020-12-22T22:14:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:25+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"DTEK uses AWS to prevent power plant equipment failures, gain real-time data access from sensors, scale SAP S/4HANA on demand, and meet data protection requirements. Based in Ukraine, DTEK Group is the largest private national investor in the Ukrainian energy sector. The company deployed its SAP S/4HANA environment for DTEK Oil \u0026 Gas on AWS, and it uses an AWS-based data lake to analyze power plant equipment problems in real time and help customers prevent failures.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/emea-customer-references/emea-directory-customer-logos/Dtek_Customer-Reference_Logo%401x.a5b4ae6f035f5ba653359b8a3f9c32fa8c114f8a.png","displayLocation":"Ukraine","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Power \u0026 Utilities","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/dtek-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"DTEK","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"DTEK Uses AWS and Real-Time Data to Proactively Solve Equipment Problems"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":