","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"AI \u0026 ML","description":"AI \u0026 ML","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:30:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-07T13:55:54+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#glue","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Glue","description":"AWS Glue","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:41+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#travel","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Travel","description":"Travel","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#big-rocks#aws-for-data","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#big-rocks","name":"AWS for Data","description":"\u003cp\u003eAWS for Data is a marketing \u0026ldquo;Big Rock\u0026rdquo; initiative that tells the story around how AWS can provide the most comprehensive set of data capabilities spanning databases, analytics, business intelligence, and machine learning for an end-to-end data strategy.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#mercadolibreml","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"mercadolibreml","dateCreated":"2022-10-18T21:00:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-05-17T00:14:47+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Mercado Libre es la plataforma de e-commerce más grandes de Latinoamérica. A cada segundo en Mercado Libre se concretan más de 11 compras y se realizan más de 6 mil búsquedas, generando un gran volumen de datos. La compañía desarrolló internamente una plataforma que permite almacenar y analizar datos para mejorar la experiencia del usuario. En este video, los expertos de Mercado Libre nos cuentan cómo las soluciones en la nube de AWS, cómo  sagemaker, Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3), y Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (Amazon EC2) ayudaron a que Mercado Libre pusiera en práctica una estrategia de Machine Learning y lograra sumar valor al producto, garantizando una experiencia de uso increíble a los más de 40 millones de usuarios de su plataforma.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/Latam%20Cases%20Assets/Mercado%20Libre_LOGO.0955d23d605c14ee7ba4d786ae7c26b703bba625.png","displayLocation":"Argentina","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Venta al por menor","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/mercadolibreml/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Mercado Libre (Mercado Livre)","publishedDate":"2020","enableShare":"1","headline":"Mercado Libre implementa su estrategia de Machine Learning con AWS","contentType":"Historia del cliente"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:3