siness. L\u0027azienda, il più grande concessionario Domino\u0027s, rappresenta il marchio Domino\u0027s in Australia, Nuova Zelanda, Belgio, Francia, Paesi Bassi, Giappone, Germania, Lussemburgo e Danimarca. Domino’s ha una rete di oltre 2.600 negozi nel mondo e la sua sede centrale si trova a Brisbane, in Australia.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Dominos-logo@1x.72555b7210dfb0aec27989c3cf03da1ba10ee1ab.png","displayLocation":"Australia","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Travel \u0026 Hospitality","sortDate":"2020-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/it/solutions/case-studies/dominos-case-study/","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Storia del cliente","customer-name":"Domino\u0027s","headline":"Domino’s Pizza Enterprises consegna in tempi record utilizzando AWS per prevedere gli ordini"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, t