the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#edenor","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"edenor","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:08:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:40:49+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Edenor es la empresa de distribución de energía más grande de Argentina, con más de dos millones y medio de clientes y cinco mil empleados. Cuenta con un área de cobertura en el Gran Buenos Aires y Capital Federal. Edenor necesitaba comenzar el camino de la transformación digital, y encontró en AWS las tecnologías necesarias para este fin.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/edenor_logo%401x.845cae7b9b23db7d2fa04e5031dfffa3f78c976c.png","displayLocation":"Argentina","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Energía y servicios públicos","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/edenor/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","customer-name":"Edenor Argentina","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"Edenor reduce 50% sus tiempos de reléase en producción con las soluciones de AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#indu