"dateUpdated":"2024-08-07T18:41:49+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"By using AWS, Autodesk scales the use of generative design to run hundreds of simulations in one hour instead of several hours or days—in turn speeding innovation in manufacturing, aerodynamics, entertainment, and more.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-customer-content/autodesk_innovator.5b3881a0245d6e17190045286f5cd18e5cafa915.png","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/autodesk-logo-2022%401x.c2c78e83fe77cfbe57e586f0465bf8f70e5089ce.png","displayLocation":"North America","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eScaling to run hundreds of simulations in 1 hour and speeding innovation\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/innovators/autodesk/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Autodesk","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Autodesk on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#innovator#autodesk","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#innovator","name":"Autodesk","description":"Autodesk","dateCreated":"2022-09-15T00:48:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-09-15T00:48:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#innovator#innovator-hub","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#innovator","name":"Item in Innovator Hub","description":"\u003cp\u003eItems with this tag are being displayed in an Innovator-specific prefiltered Directory.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-06-14T22:12:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-06-14T22:12:04+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#media-entertainment","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","description":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:07+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#bmw-severless-reinvent-2020","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"bmw-severless-reinvent-2020","dateCreated":"2022-11-08T04:15:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-03-02T02:48:49+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Data drives BMW’s personalized customer experiences, connected mobility solutions, and analytical insights. This session walks through the journey of building BMW Group’s Cloud Data Hub. BMW Group’s technical lead, Simon Kern, dives deep into how the company is leveraging AWS serverless capabilities for delivering ETL functions on big data in a modularized, accessible, and repeatable fashion and provides insight into the next steps of the journey. The services used in BMW Group’s AWS architecture are discussed, including AWS Glue, Amazon Athena, Amazon SageMaker, and more.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/BMWGroup_logo_200x70_1X.3445718b3f949f158f9e3cac77d3ee79d4767a7f.jpg","displayLocation":"Germany","customerNameLower":"bmw","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Automotive","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/bmw-severless-reinvent-2020/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"BMW","publishedDate":"2020","enableShare":"1","headline":"How BMW Group uses AWS serverless analytics for a data-driven ecosystem","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T0