ys. Avec ses 150 000 collaborateurs, il s’affirme comme le premier fournisseur de services à l’énergie dans le monde. Au sein d’ENGIE, la structure ENGIE Digital a été créée en octobre 2016, et prend en charge la transformation numérique du Groupe.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Engie_Logo@1x.0c113ddc2f31b59cf84d5b3d7dfdfef6570f1331.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"engie","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Energy","sortDate":"2019-07-09","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/engie-digital/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"ENGIE","publishedDate":"2019","enableShare":"1","headline":"ENGIE Digital réalise sa transition digitale avec AWS et C3 IoT","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#athena","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Athena","description":"Amazon Athena","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#sustainability","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Sustainability","description":"Sustainability","dateCreated":"2022-01-18T21:36:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-09T21:31:10+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-refer