, payments, and marketing technologies. Voyager Innovations chose SAP HANA Enterprise Cloud on AWS because of its quick availability, faster deployment, flexibility with the shortest path to production, built-in security frameworks and business continuity.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/VoyagerInnovation_Customer-Reference_Logo.b9f45847e5d42f72fe72e88d440a4df0862471e9.png","displayLocation":"Philippines","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eVoyager Innovations is the leading technology company in the Philippines focused on developing customer-centric, digital platforms, services and solutions for emerging markets in the areas of financial services, payments, and marketing technologies. Through its various products, it is enabling enterprises and consumers to participate in the New Economy. An AWS customer since 2014, Voyager Innovations now uses more than 50 AWS Services to constantly innovate and protect data. Voyager Innovations chose SAP HANA Enterprise Cloud on AWS in 2018 because of its quick availability, faster deployment, flexibility with the shortest path to production, built in security frameworks and business continuity.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/voyager-innovation/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Voyager Innovation","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Voyager Innovation Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#migration-transfer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","description":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","da