net on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#robot-care-systems-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"robot-care-systems-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T14:56:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:27+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"By using AWS RoboMaker to connect Lea, its robotic assistive walker, to the cloud, Robot Care Systems added an intuitive voice interface, OTA updates, and machine-learning-based analytics. The company builds robotic healthcare devices to help people live more independently.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/logos/lea-logo.54b78281b7f2d8fb61af8552deccdf14a3e89ec3.jpg","displayLocation":"Netherlands","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eBy using AWS RoboMaker to connect Lea, its robotic assistive walker, to the cloud, Robot Care Systems added an intuitive voice interface, OTA updates, and machine-learning?based analytics. The company builds robotic healthcare devices to help people live more independently. Robot Care Systems is using AWS RoboMaker for ROS cloud extensions, Amazon Lex and Amazon Polly to support a voice interface, Amazon Rekognition for facial recognition, and Amazon SageMaker for machine learning for autonomous navigation.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/robotcaresystems/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Robot Care Systems","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Robot Care Systems Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Polly","description":"Amazon Polly","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:53+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:54+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#netherlands","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Netherlands","description":"Netherlands","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#robomaker","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS RoboMaker","description":"AWS RoboMaker","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:57+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rekognition","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Rekognition","description":"Amazon Rekognition","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","lo