15T21:43:39+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"IAC Publishing is an online publisher that operates popular websites such as The Daily Beast, Dotdash, Investopedia, and Dictionary.com. A division of New York City–based media and internet company IAC, IAC Publishing’s collection of leading content brands reaches more than 100 million users in the United States every month.","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"iac publishing","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/iac-publishing/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2019","enableShare":"1","customer-name":"IAC Publishing","headline":"IAC Publishing Deploys Software Daily, Saves $15 Million Annually Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elastic-beanstalk","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Elastic Beanstalk","description":"AWS Elastic Beanstalk","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#website-hosting","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Website Hosting","description":"Website Hosting","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:07:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:36:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020