itizenry and new opportunities for startups among the top benefits of moving to the AWS Cloud. The institution is Canada\u0027s only 100 percent open and online digital university, and 70 percent of its students are the first in their families to achieve a university degree.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/AthabascaUniversity_Customer-Reference_Logo.680c1cee0d4a7f2d54dc41c5fb3b85769ab6b379.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRead the Athabasca University customer case study, powered by the AWS cloud. AWS provides cloud computing services to hundreds of thousands of customers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Education","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/athabasca-university/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Athabasca University","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Athabasca University Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#government-public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"government-public-sector","description":"Government \u0026 Public Sector","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2020-11-25T01:38:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#general-public-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"General Public Services","description":"General Public Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:04+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#education","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:01+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#aws-case-study-university-of-notre-dame","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"aws-case-study-university-of-notre-dame","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T19:58:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2020-11-21T11:12:00+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Using N2WS from AWS Marketplace, Notre Dame is better protected from outages, and it saves up to 25 percent of the time previously spent performing manual data backups.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/university-of-notre-dame_logo@1x.0923daf425449e237f7e340b00e32ba391b2358a.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe University of Notre Dame engaged with AWS to re-evaluate their web server infrastructure and needed a way to burst capacity on-demand to meet high throughput website activity when site traffic spiked in response to on-campus events like sporting events. They have been very pleased with their implementation and the performance is better than that of their former on-site infrastructure. Notre Dame is now considering additional workloads to migrate into the AWS Cloud.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Education","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/university-notre-dame-aws-marketplace-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"University of Notre Dame","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"University of Notre Dame Protects Critical Systems Using N2WS Solution from AWS Marketplace"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#backup-restore","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#ca