licom","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:07:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:38+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"undada en 1992, Millicom es un proveedor líder de servicios móviles y de cable dedicado a los mercados emergentes principalmente en América Latina. Millicom marca el ritmo cuando se trata de proporcionar servicios de banda ancha de alta velocidad e innovación en torno al Estilo de Vida Digital a través de su marca principal, TIGO. Al 31 de diciembre del 2018, las subsidiarias operativas y joint ventures de Millicom emplearon a más de 21,000 personas y brindaron servicios móviles a aproximadamente 50 millones de clientes en la región, con una huella de cable en más de 11 millones de hogares.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/millicom_logo%401x.89267bbb207af3a7b245dce9809752f369518e6d.png","displayLocation":"Latinoamérica","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Telecomunicaciones","sortDate":"2019-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/millicom/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Historia del cliente","customer-name":"Millicom","headline":"Caso de Éxito: Millicom"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#datacenter-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Datacenter Migration","description":"Datacenter Migration","dateCreated":"2020-08-18T05:17:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:39+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"i