irectory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#goepik","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"goepik","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:09:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:41+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"A GoEpik é uma startup que oferece uma plataforma de hiper-customização de processos permitindo a empresas e empreendedores criarem de maneira autônoma soluções para Indústria 4.0 e transformação digital.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/Latam%20Cases%20Assets/GoEpik_LOGO1.abca976be3d8a59eebe454dac1a3aaad7098dc73.jpg","displayLocation":"Brasil","footerInfoText":"Data de publicação","industry":"Serviços profissionais","sortDate":"2019-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/solutions/case-studies/goepik/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"História do cliente","customer-name":"GoEpik","headline":"Estudo de caso AWS: GoEpik"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GL