ld. TechSoup offers a range of technology implementation and management services to nonprofits with diverse missions including promoting health and welfare, achieving medical breakthroughs, protecting wildlife, and many other causes.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/TechSoup_Customer-Reference_Logo.cd7129b6b558221f13eba9eb5856bd22e6b15fb0.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eUsing AWS, TechSoup quickly and securely provides technology to nonprofits around the world. TechSoup offers a range of technology implementation and management services to nonprofits with diverse missions including promoting health and welfare, achieving medical breakthroughs, protecting wildlife, and many other causes. TechSoup is developing a cooperative technology platform using AWS technology that will allow the organization to better utilize its data and allow nonprofits to learn from each other.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Nonprofit","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/techsoup/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"TechSoup","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"TechSoup Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector-nonprofit","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Nonprofit","description":"Nonprofit","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-09T21:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2019-09-23T21:02:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#non-profit","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Non-profit","description":"Non-profit","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2022-01-10T20:16:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#aerobotics-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"aerobotics-case-study","dateCreated":"2020-11-09T18:03:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-23T00:55:33+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Aerobotics was founded in Cape Town, South Africa, in 2014 to help tree-crop farmers solve their pest and disease problems. The company uses machine learning to analyze imagery from drone and satellite photography, allowing farmers to understand the condition of individual trees. Monitoring every tree for pests and diseases on a 50-hectare farm would previously take a farmer an entire day. Aerobotics has reduced this to 20 minutes with drone technology. In this video, Aerobotics Chief Executive Officer James Paterson explains why the firm chose Amazon Web Services (AWS). Built on the AWS Cloud, its product can process large amounts of data and still work reliably for thousands of farmers in remote rural areas. The company runs an auto-scaling microservices architecture with Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) and serves data to customers using Amazon CloudFront. Its continuous integration and deployment pipelines allow software developers and data scientists to work independently in containerized environments.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Aerobotics_Customer-References_Logo@1x.160065e8a508988e70b8eac2576a2ea3967757b5.png","displayLocation":"South Africa","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Agriculture","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/aerobotics-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Aerobotics","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Aerobotics Tackles Tree Pests with Machine Learning"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#middle-east-africa","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Middle East \u0026 Africa","description":"Middle East \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:53+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#content-delivery","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Content Delivery","description":"Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:38+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:37+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"20