stry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#saint-louis-university-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"saint-louis-university-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T15:10:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-01-21T02:44:58+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Saint Louis University (SLU) is the first university to bring virtual personal assistants into every student residence on its campus and to equip them with a private, SLU-specific skill using Alexa for Business. SLU placed more than 2,300 Amazon Echo Dots in residence hall rooms and student apartments in the fall of 2018.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/SaintLouisUniversity_Customer-Reference_Logo.19f1a619ddbeff44b3096f1a4f8e46ab2dea710d.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eSaint Louis University (SLU) is the first university to bring virtual personal assistants into every student residence on its campus and to equip them with a private, SLU-specific skill using Alexa for Business. SLU placed more than 2,300 Amazon Echo Dots in residence hall rooms and student apartments in the fall of 2018. The SLU skill\u0014built by N-Powered and deployed through Alexa for Business to all Alexa-enabled devices on campus\u0014provides instant answers to more than 100 custom questions, including: \u001cWhat time does the library close tonight?\u001d and \u001cWhere is the registrar\u0019s office?\u001d\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Education","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/saint-louis-university/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Saint Louis University","enableShare"