adlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/university-of-oklahoma/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"University of Oklahoma","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"University of Oklahoma Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2019-09-23T21:02:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector-edu","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-21T23:55:12+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2022-01-10T20:16:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#education","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:01+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#pirelli-video","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"pirelli-video","dateCreated":"2020-11-09T18:07:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-23T01:00:21+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Founded in Milan, Italy, in 1872, Pirelli makes more than 75 million high-performance tires a year for cars, motorcycles, and bicycles. The organization employs more than 30,000 people in 13 countries.Pirelli has a history of manufacturing innovation and has recently set up Pirelli Digital, which is dedicated to developing smart products such as Pirelli Connesso. Connesso combines in-tire sensors with a mobile app to inform drivers about tire pressure, temperature, wear, and more in real time.The backend for Connesso—and several other digital services at Pirelli—is built on Amazon Web Services (AWS), with Amazon Aurora powering its database. Pirelli chose AWS to give its digital teams the ability to quickly develop and test products and build a highly secure environment for sensitive data.In this video, Daniel Benedict, head of ICT innovation architecture at Pirelli, explains how the company uses AWS to develop new products.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Pirelli_Customer-Reference_Logo@1x.d12655d2476a3454ea72b343200523653bd8c0e6.png","displayLocation":"Italy","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Manufacturing","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/pirelli-video/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Pirelli Brings Cloud Intelligence to Its Tires with AWS","customer-name":"Pirelli"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#dev-and-test","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Dev \u0026 Test","description":"Dev \u0026 Test","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-17T20:28:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#italy","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Italy","description":"Italy","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Mobile","description":"Mobile","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-24T02:42:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","description":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-15T04:54:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#manufacturing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Manufacturing","description":"Manufacturing","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#aurora","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Aurora","description":"Amazon Aurora","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#iot","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"IoT","description":"IoT","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#iot","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"IoT","description":"IoT","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#netafim-video","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"netafim-video","dateCreated":"2020-11-09T18:06:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-01-03T17:48:30+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eHeadquartered in Israel, Netafim is the world\u0026#39;s largest irrigation company by market share, with more than $1 billion in sales and 5,000 employees. Its 17 plants manufacture precision drip irrigation equipment, which is sold in 110 countries. The firm\u0026#39;s guiding principle is to help farmers grow more with less\u0026mdash;a mantra that is becoming increasingly relevant as the global population increases and climate change makes water a scarce resource for billions of people. Netafim\u0026#39;s NETBEAT\u0026mdash;\u0026ldquo;the world\u0026#39;s first irrigation system with a brain\u0026rdquo;\u0026mdash;places sensors in fields to collect data about crops and sends the information to cloud-connected units that control fertilizer and watering systems. The units incorporate data from weather forecasts and Netafim\u0026#39;s algorithms to aid plant growth. In this video, Izhar Gilad, vice president of product and business development for digital farming at Netafim, explains why the company uses AWS to deliver NETBEAT, and how AWS helped it transform from an industrial manufacturer to a firm focused on services and data.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Netafilm_Customer-Reference_Logo@1x.e4d9bc60f02263dd0f6ca9429e149686b0b34001.png","displayLocation":"Israel","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Agriculture","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/netafim-video/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Netafim","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Netafim Helps Farmers Grow More with Less"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#middle-east-africa","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Middle East \u0026 Africa","description":"Middle East \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:53+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#iot-core","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS IoT Core","description":"AWS IoT Core","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:42+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#sustainability","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Sustainability","description":"Sustainability","dateCreated":"2021-07-02T05:53:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis","description":"Amazon Kinesis","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:45+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#middle-east","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Middle East","description":"Middle East","dateCreated":"2020-04-09T03:53:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:53+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#agriculture","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Agriculture","description":"Agriculture","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:02:53+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:00+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#israel","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Israel","description":"Israel","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:55+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#iot","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"IoT","description":"IoT","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#fife-public-schools","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"fife-public-schools","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T15:11:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-01-21T02:39:40+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"By using Amazon AppStream 2.0, Fife School District\u0027s students can now access applications from anywhere, anytime, on any device. Fife Public Schools in Washington aspires to be a top-tier learning organization in which all students are being prepared for college, career, and life.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/WWPS/images/Fife-School-District-Logo-2.cf90eb81815e7126adf7659945a8e95a351f2e57.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eBy using Amazon AppStream 2.0, Fife School District\u0019s students can now access applications from anywhere, anytime, on any device. Fife Public Schools in Washington aspires to be a top-tier learning organization in which all students are being prepared for college, career, and life. Fife School District provides a device for every kid in the district. While the kids automatically got access to some applications, there were certain programs they couldn\u0019t access, especially those used in CTE (Careers in Technical Education) classes. In addition to providing equitable access using Amazon AppStream 2.0, the district turned labs back into learning spaces, which saved the district money it would have otherwise spent on building costs.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Education","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/fife-public-schools/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Fife Public Schools","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Fife Public Schools"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#euc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"End-User Computing (EUC)","description":"End-User Computing (EUC)","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2019-09-23T21:02:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#euc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"End-User Computing (EUC)","description":"End-User Computing (EUC)","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-03T00:20:21+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#education","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:01+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2022-01-10T20:16:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector-edu","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-21T23:55:12+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#cargotec-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"cargotec-case-study","dateCreated":"2020-11-09T18:03:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T22:32:35+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Finland-based Cargotec provides equipment and solutions for the cargo-handling industry and employs 11,000 people in more than 100 countries. Its products deal with one-quarter of the world’s 700 million annual container movements and can be found on half of all ships listed with the International Maritime Organization.Today, the company’s focus lies in bringing data-driven solutions to market that help cargo carriers increase efficiency, transparency, and cooperation. The aim is to reduce the €17 billion a year loss that the industry suffers globally due to inefficiency, as well as the 90 million equivalent metric tons of CO2 wasted in moving empty containers.In this video, Soili Mäkinen, chief information officer and senior vice president, digitalization, at Cargotec, explains how the firm uses Amazon Web Services (AWS) to make sense of data, bringing a new level of intelligence to cargo handling.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Cargotec_Customer-Reference@Logo1x.33bbce9851ec689ece3deaa91dc9a157ab40a6a6.png","displayLocation":"Finland","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Transport \u0026 Logistics","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/cargotec-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Cargotec Shares Its Vision for the Future of Shipping","customer-name":"Cargotec"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#finland","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Finland","description":"Finland","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:08+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#transport-logistics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Transport \u0026 Logistics","description":"Transport \u0026 Logistics","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#nordics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Nordics","description":"Nordics","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:50+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#mapfre-video","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"mapfre-video","dateCreated":"2020-11-09T18:06:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T20:28:17+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Spain-based Insurance firm MAPFRE employs 36,000 people in 100 countries and serves 30 million customers worldwide. In this video, Mónica García Cristóbal, digital IT director at MAPFRE, explains how the company developed its framework for building mobile apps on Amazon Web Services (AWS) with services such as AWS Lambda. The framework relies on the principles of continuous deployment and infrastructure as code, so MAPFRE can quickly deliver scalable mobile applications to a global customer base.Using AWS, MAPFRE has lowered time to market by 40 percent because it can deploy on various device types with one source of code. The business has also reduced costs by 20 percent by paying for infrastructure only when it needs it, and scaling up and down quickly to match demand.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Mapfre_Customer-Reference_Logo@1x.d9d873fd9021f8a685f440bc1bcf522f10cf820b.png","displayLocation":"Spain","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Insurance","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/mapfre-video/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"MAPFRE Lowers Time to Market by 40% Using AWS","customer-name":"MAPFRE"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#dev-and-test","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Dev \u0026 Test","description":"Dev \u0026 Test","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-17T20:28:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Mobile","description":"Mobile","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-24T02:42:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-24T02:42:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","description":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#spain","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Spain","description":"Spain","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#methodology#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#methodology","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:06:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#iberia","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Iberia","description":"Iberia","dateCreated":"2020-04-09T03:37:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#insurance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Insurance","description":"Insurance","dateCreated":"2021-12-14T00:56:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#jaguar-land-lover-video","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"jaguar-land-lover-video","dateCreated":"2020-11-09T18:06:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T20:19:11+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Jaguar Land Rover (JLR) combines the heritage of two iconic British automotive brands while continuing to innovate in a rapidly changing industry. Customers expect more autonomous, connected, and electrified vehicles, so Jaguar Land Rover is using Amazon Web Services (AWS) to share its application programming interfaces (APIs) with trusted partners to innovate faster.In this video, Peter Virk, the company’s director of connected car and future technology, explains how the company is using AWS to integrate new, cloud-based technology into Jaguar Land Rover cars. For example, JLR has added Amazon Alexa features to vehicles, including the fully electric Jaguar I-PACE, so that customers can ask Alexa whether their car has enough range to complete their journey. Engineers are also using cloud-based analytics to improve battery performance, helping customers ensure batteries are fully charged for their journey.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Jaguar_Customer-Reference_Logo@1x.bb723dac8f9026b226ed98f1dba265bf70c1b3bf.png","displayLocation":"United Kingdom","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Automotive","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/jaguar-land-rover-video/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Jaguar Land Rover Builds Experiences for Tomorrow’s Drivers Using AWS","customer-name":"Jaguar Land Rover"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#alexa","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Alexa for Business","description":"Alexa for Business","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:15+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#business-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:22:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#uk","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United Kingdom","description":"United Kingdom","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:52+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#ukir","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"UK/IR","description":"UK/IR","dateCreated":"2020-02-19T23:06:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:51+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#automotive","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Automotive","description":"Automotive","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:00+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#fender-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"fender-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T14:57:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T19:27:34+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Fender went all in on AWS to better engage with customers and gain supply-chain efficiencies. Fender, made famous by the likes of Jimi Hendrix, is the world\u0027s largest maker of stringed instruments by revenue. Fender runs its Fender Play, Fender Tune, and Fender Tone apps on AWS, which help customers learn to play guitar, tune their instruments, and control digital amplifiers.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Fender_Customer-Reference_Logo.c8c65465ed9686063493447e187bd08a3e5dba40.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eFender went all in on AWS to better engage with customers and gain supply-chain efficiencies. Fender is the world\u0026#39;s largest maker of stringed instruments and guitars by revenue, made famous by the likes of Jimi Hendrix. Fender runs its Fender Play, Fender Tune, and Fender Tone apps on AWS, which help customers learn to play guitar, tune their instruments, and control digital amplifiers. The company uses AWS services including AWS Lambda, Amazon DynamoDB, and Amazon API Gateway to store and deliver more than 700 TB of video and more than 4.9 million lessons to customers. The company also uses IoT on AWS to monitor factory conditions and Amazon SageMaker to choose the best wood to use in its guitars. Ethan Kaplan, chief product officer at Fender, spoke at re:Invent 2018.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Manufacturing","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/fender/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Fender","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Fender Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","description":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#dynamodb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon DynamoDB","description":"Amazon DynamoDB","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#api-gateway","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon API Gateway","description":"Amazon API Gateway","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sagemaker","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon SageMaker","description":"Amazon SageMaker","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#manufacturing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Manufacturing","description":"Manufacturing","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#iot","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"IoT","description":"IoT","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#iot","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"IoT","description":"IoT","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#miovision-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"miovision-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T15:12:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T19:23:14+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Miovision uses AWS to capture and analyze IoT data from thousands of connected devices at traffic intersections around the world. Through connected sensors and intelligent analytics, Miovision empowers more than 17,000 municipalities in 50 countries to be smarter, improving transportation capacity, safety, cost-effectiveness, and performance.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Miovision_Customer-Reference_Logo.073de87da261a97dbf5eed794d465193cc5d5dd4.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eMiovision uses AWS to capture and analyze IoT data from thousands of connected devices at traffic intersections around the world.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/miovision/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Miovision","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Miovision Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#website-hosting","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Website Hosting","description":"Website Hosting","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:07:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:36:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#dynamodb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon DynamoDB","description":"Amazon DynamoDB","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#web-hosting","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Web Hosting","description":"Web Hosting","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-30T20:30:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis","description":"Amazon Kinesis","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:45+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#union-medical-healthcare-umh-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"union-medical-healthcare-umh-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T15:19:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:35:22+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Union Medical Healthcare (UMH) can produce key financial reports 50 percent faster while giving executives real-time insight into the company\u0027s business performance with SAP S/4HANA Finance running on AWS. UMH provides medical and healthcare services in the Greater China Region.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/UnionMedicalHealthcare_Customer-Reference_Logo.1973ac4bc7c08cecb62ce5b145e44036fbfd5e01.png","displayLocation":"Hong Kong","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eUMH studied the possibility of running SAP S/4HANA Finance on a cloud-based infrastructure. The company looked at offerings from Amazon Web Services (AWS), the Google Cloud Platform (GCP), and China-based Tencent Cloud. Says Ngai, \u001cWe quickly determined that GCP didn\u0019t have locations in China, so we decided not to use it. AWS, however, did have Chinese locations and it had worked with SAP to certify the AWS Cloud for SAP S/4HANA.\u001d\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/umh/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Union Medical Healthcare (UMH)","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Union Medical Healthcare (UMH) Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#migration-transfer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","description":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#business-applications","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-17T20:28:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#business-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:22:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T0