 Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#alpha-vertex-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"alpha-vertex-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T15:12:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:44+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Alpha Vertex achieved the multi-gigabyte throughput crucial to its central line of business by using Amazon EFS. Alpha Vertex uses artificial-intelligence tools to build a model of the global financial system so it can provide investors with returns predictions, research assistance, and automated monitoring and analysis of worldwide financial media.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/AlphaVertex_Customer-Reference_Logo.c957697aab599928c727564c9e9e616944509906.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRead the Alpha Vertex customer case study, powered by the AWS cloud. AWS provides cloud computing services to hundreds of thousands of customers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/alpha-vertex/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Alpha Vertex","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Alpha Vertex Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#mid-market","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Mid-Market","description":"Mid-Market","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#efs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic File System (EFS)","description":"Amazon Elastic File System (EFS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#northern-virginia-community-college-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"northern-virginia-community-college-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T14:58:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:43+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Northern Virginia Community College (NOVA), in collaboration with the AWS Educate program, rolled out a Cloud Computing specialization as part of its Information Systems Technology (IST) Associate of Applied Science degree starting in Fall 2018. The program is one of the first cloud computing degrees in the nation offered by a community college.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/NorthernVirginiaCommunityCollege_Customer-Reference_Logo.4f3b402c3b4fe3a59fc99a1dded30131c2bf6546.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRead the NOVA customer case study, powered by the AWS Cloud. AWS provides cloud computing services to hundreds of thousands of customers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Education","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/NOVA/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Northern Virginia Community College","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Northern Virginia Community College Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#mid-market","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Mid-Market","description":"Mid-Market","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#education","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:01+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#fusefx-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"fusefx-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T14:57:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:49+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"FuseFX achieves unlimited CGI render-farm scale by seamlessly adding cloud render nodes with AWS Thinkbox Deadline. FuseFX uses its proprietary content-creation pipeline to build visual effects for episodic television, feature films, commercials, and virtual-reality productions.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/EnterpriseDigitalMarketing/EDM_EC2/GEN_fusefx_150x100_May-2018.4ac313c94126712bc4581242a7e3dbbc884f870e.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eFuseFX achieves unlimited CGI render-farm scale by seamlessly adding cloud render nodes with AWS Thinkbox Deadline. FuseFX uses its proprietary content-creation pipeline to build visual effects for episodic television, feature films, commercials, and virtual-reality productions. The company is using Thinkbox Deadline to manage and administer CGI render nodes built using Amazon Machine Image templates and Amazon EC2 Spot Instances.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/fusefx/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"FuseFX","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"FuseFX Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#high-performance-computing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"High Performance Computing","description":"High Performance Computing","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-26T01:35:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#media-entertainment","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","description":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#mid-market","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Mid-Market","description":"Mid-Market","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#high-perform-compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"High Performance Compute","description":"High Performance Compute","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T06:37:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#royal-dutch-shell-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"royal-dutch-shell-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T14:57:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:40:46+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Relying on AWS as its infrastructure provider of choice for its Splunk Enterprise cybersecurity solution, Royal Dutch Shell matured a large data lake for historical analysis. Headquartered in the Netherlands, Royal Dutch Shell is a British-Dutch multinational oil and gas company with operations in more than 70 countries and an interest in 22 refineries around the globe.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/shell_Customer-Reference_Logo.ba09dfe42f0b57c1cee69c3f6ba9660de40f4f3f.png","displayLocation":"Netherlands","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRelying on AWS as its infrastructure provider of choice for its Splunk Enterprise cybersecurity solution, Royal Dutch Shell matured a large data lake for historical analysis. Headquartered in the Netherlands, Royal Dutch Shell is a British-Dutch multinational oil and gas company with operations in more than 70 countries and an interest in 22 refineries around the globe. The company uses Amazon EC2 and Amazon EBS for its Splunk environment on AWS, which helps it find more than twice as many events that could have resulted in security incidents and breaches.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Energy","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/royal-dutch-shell/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Royal Dutch Shell","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Royal Dutch Shell Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#netherlands","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Netherlands","description":"Netherlands","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#high-performance-computing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"High Performance Computing","description":"High Performance Computing","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-26T01:35:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story