ciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#amazon-advertising-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"amazon-advertising-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T14:58:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-19T03:04:55+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Amazon Advertising Engineering and Development (AED) increased throughput and avoided a three-year project to rebuild performance monitors and management tools by shifting data held in Oracle databases to Amazon RDS. AED builds, manages, and scales the technologies that undergird Amazon\u0027s programmatic advertising offerings.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/amazon-logo-1x.a64c3eedfb84347ecf50e210637c0cf810922e10.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Advertising Engineering and Development (AED) increased throughput exponentially and avoided a three-year project to rebuild performance monitors and management tools by shifting data held in Oracle databases to Amazon RDS. AED builds, manages, and scales the technologies that undergird Amazon\u0026#39;s programmatic advertising offerings. The new solution uses PostgreSQL relational databases that are fully managed by Amazon RDS, with Amazon S3 for storing backups.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Retail","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/Amazonadvertising/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Amazon Advertising","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Amazon Advertising Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Migration","description":"Migration","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rds","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon RDS","description":"Amazon RDS","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#general-database-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"General Database Migration","description":"General Database Migration","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T06:37:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#database-migration-service","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Database Migration Service (DMS)","description":"AWS Database Migration Service (DMS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#retail","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Retail","description":"Retail","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:08+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#database-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Database Migration","description":"Database Migration","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#innovator","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Innovator","description":"Innovator","dateCreated":"2022-04-05T21:17:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-06-27T20:43:35+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#innovator#amazon","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#innovator","name":"Amazon","description":"Amazon","dateCreated":"2022-04-25T19:05:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-06-27T20:43:38+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#epic-games-case-study-de","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"epic-games-case-study-de","dateCreated":"2024-09-18T20:04:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-09-18T20:08:09+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Epic Games nutzt AWS, um Fortnite mehr als 200 Millionen Spielern weltweit bereitzustellen, ein Wachstum um das 100-fache in nur zwölf Monaten zu fördern und mit Analysen eine Verbesserung des Spiels zu erreichen. Fortnite, eines der weltweit beliebtesten Videospiele, wird nahezu vollständig auf AWS ausgeführt: seine weltweite Gameserver-Flotte, Backend-Services, Datenbanken, Websites, Analyse-Pipeline- und Verarbeitungssysteme und mehr. Mit Hilfe diverser AWS-Services kann Epic Games die erforderliche Verfügbarkeit bereitstellen, um Nutzungsspitzen, die bis zu 10-mal höher als Nebenzeiten sind, zu unterstützen. Auch die nötige Skalierbarkeit, um Spieleereignisse mit allen 200 Millionen Nutzern zu hosten, kann Epic Games so gewährleisten. Chris Dyl, Director of Platform bei Epic Games, im Rahmen eines Vortrags auf der re:Invent 2018.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/EpicGames_Customer-Reference_Logo.8a439eccad8e4f56fc6f9733371dfecc459b5ba3.png","displayLocation":"Amerika","customerNameLower":"epic games","industry":"Computerspiele","sortDate":"2018-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/de/solutions/case-studies/EPICGames/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Kundengeschichte","customer-name":"Epic Games","headline":"AWS re:Invent 2018: Epic Games nutzt AWS, um Fortnite für 200 Millionen Spieler bereitzustellen"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#german","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"German","description":"German","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:24+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-24T02:42:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry