ublic Sector","dateCreated":"2022-01-10T20:16:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#euc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"End-User Computing (EUC)","description":"End-User Computing (EUC)","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-03T00:20:21+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#education","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:01+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#soundexchange-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"soundexchange-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T15:12:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-01-21T02:39:44+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Using AWS, SoundExchange was able to transform its technology to be efficient, reliable, flexible, and fast. SoundExchange develops business solutions to benefit the entire music industry, and collects and distributes digital performance royalties on behalf of more than 155,000 recording artists and master rights owners.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/WWPS/images/SoundExchangeLogo.f0d68609fe7bbde5db158e0ef1c24aceccaef9ac.jpg","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eUsing AWS, SoundExchange was able to transform its technology to be efficient, reliable, flexible, and fast. SoundExchange develops business solutions to benefit the entire music industry, and collects and distributes digital performance royalties on behalf of more than 155,000 recording artists and master rights owners. In 2012, SoundExchange began using Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (Amazon EC2) and Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) to host its corporate website. Since then, the company has added capabilities including Elastic Load Balancing and Auto Scaling. From its website to its core business processes to its royalty-administration platform, SoundExchange uses AWS to save money and improve performance.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/soundexchange/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"SoundExchange","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"SoundExchange Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector-nonprofit","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Nonprofit","description":"Nonprofit","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-09T21:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#media-entertainment","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","description":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#website-hosting","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Website Hosting","description":"Website Hosting","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:07:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:36:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#auto-scaling","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Auto Scaling","description":"AWS Auto Scaling","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#web-hosting","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Web Hosting","description":"Web Hosting","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-30T20:30:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Elastic Load Balancing (ELB)","description":"Elastic Load Balancing (ELB)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2019-09-23T21:02:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2022-01-10T20:16:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#non-profit","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Non-profit","description":"Non-profit","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#santa-monica-college-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"santa-monica-college-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T15:11:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-01-21T02:39:42+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"The California Cloud Workforce Project, a consortium of 19 LA County community colleges and their sister high schools, offers a Cloud Computing Certificate. The CA Cloud curriculum was designed collaboratively by faculty at Santa Monica College and AWS Educate, with the support of subject matter experts from AWS and other LA-based tech companies to equip students with cloud skills needed for careers in the tech industry.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/SantaMonicaCollege_Customer-Reference_Logo.b676d03ea86325f2e2c52545e76b35dcadae5412.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRead the Santa Monica College customer case study, powered by the AWS Cloud. AWS provides cloud computing services to hundreds of thousands of customers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Education","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/santa-monica-college/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Santa Monica College","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Santa Monica College Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#government-public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"government-public-sector","description":"Government \u0026 Public Sector","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2020-11-25T01:38:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#general-public-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"General Public Services","description":"General Public Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:04+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2019-09-23T21:02:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#education","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:01+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2022-01-10T20:16:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector-edu","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-21T23:55:12+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#icmec-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"icmec-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T14:58:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-01-21T02:44:51+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"By moving to the AWS Cloud, the International Centre for Missing \u0026 Exploited Children (ICMEC) reduced the costs of maintenance and pushed its IT teams to be more creative. ICMEC\u0026#39;s mission is to eradicate child abduction, sexual abuse, and exploitation.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/WWPS/images/ICMEC_logo.b1a0341dcea0f09958bd3d80c050306875e3816c.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eBy moving to the AWS Cloud, the International Centre for Missing \u0026amp; Exploited Children (ICMEC) reduced the costs of maintenance and pushed its IT teams to be more creative. ICMEC\u0026#39;s mission is to eradicate child abduction, sexual abuse, and exploitation. ICMEC created the GMCNgine, a centralized platform that uses artificial intelligence, machine learning, and Amazon Rekognition to scour the internet for photos of children to compare against images from ongoing cases of missing children from across the globe. The results provide law enforcement and NGOs with leads on the possible whereabouts of missing children.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Nonprofit","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/icmec/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"ICMEC","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"ICMEC Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector-nonprofit","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Nonprofit","description":"Nonprofit","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-09T21:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rekognition","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Rekognition","description":"Amazon Rekognition","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"AI \u0026 ML","description":"AI \u0026 ML","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:30:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-07T13:55:54+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2019-09-23T21:02:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#non-profit","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Non-profit","description":"Non-profit","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2022-01-10T20:16:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#renault-video","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"renault-video","dateCreated":"2020-11-09T18:05:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T23:25:59+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Founded in 1899, Groupe Renault manufactures and sells 3.75 million cars and light commercial vehicles each year under five main brands.The automotive industry is changing. People are using more mobility services like ride-sharing apps, and those that own cars are buying more used vehicles. This represents a challenge to the business models of long-established automakers like Renault.The group has responded with a wide-ranging digital transformation, focusing more on services. Central to this transformation has been the use of Amazon Web Services, specifically Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS), AWS Lambda, and Amazon Relational Database Service (Amazon RDS).In this video, Pierre Houlès, chief information officer for sales and marketing at Renault, explains how the group handled the challenge of decades of legacy technology and how a shift to DevOps changed the way the business operates. Plus, see how the success of Renault’s first project on the new platform increased sales conversion rates by 15X and customer contacts by 25X, giving the business the confidence to continue its cloud journey.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Renault_Customer-Reference_Logo@1x.8da9e1844df45c643420f8d49bc7ab4fdf5d4a93.png","displayLocation":"France","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Automotive","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/renault-video/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Renault Transforms IT for a New Automotive Sector","customer-name":"Groupe Renault"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#customer-engagement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Customer Engagement","description":"Customer Engagement","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-21T23:37:45+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#websites-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Websites \u0026 Apps","description":"Websites \u0026 Apps","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-05T03:54:13+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Engli