oy IT services themselves. \"Our technologists can easily deploy our application builds to production using the AWS Service Catalog self-service portal, without having to open tickets,\" Dincer says. \"As a result, they can launch a new application stack in five minutes instead of the many weeks it would typically take. Because of AWS Service Catalog, we are enabling DevOps and automation at Wiley.\"","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/wiley_logo@1x.d3fba44e14d1a59bcf416eb6ab094fce0757add5.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Education","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/wiley/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Wiley enables self-service and launches new application stacks in five minutes using AWS Service Catalog","customer-name":"John Wiley \u0026 Sons"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#service-catalog","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Service Catalog","description":"AWS Service Catalog","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:00+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#mgmt-governance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Management \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-05T02:54:01+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#methodology#devops","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#methodology","name":"DevOps","description":"DevOps","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:06:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:10+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mgmt-govern","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Management \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#education","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:01+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#devops","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"DevOps","description":"DevOps","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-05T03:54:11+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#alameda-county-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"alameda-county-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T17:08:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-01-21T02:40:16+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Alameda County, California avoided $20,000 in application-development costs and gained the scalability to serve thousands of concurrent users by migrating its election-map viewer application—formerly hosted on premises—to AWS. Alameda County is the seventh-most populous county in California, with 14 incorporated cities and more than 1.5 million people.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/AlamedaCounty_Customer-Reference_Logo.8eeec243adfeee2f8cf142086ec250100f7c4890.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eAlameda County, California avoided $20,000 in application-development costs and gained the scalability to serve thousands of concurrent users by migrating its election-map viewer application\u0014formerly hosted on premises\u0014to AWS. \u0026nbsp;Alameda County is the seventh-most populous county in California, with 14 incorporated cities and more than 1.5 million people. \u0026nbsp;The county uses AWS Lambda serverless compute and Amazon S3 storage to create maps of election results that are provided to users through the Amazon CloudFront content delivery network.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Government","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/alameda-county/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Alameda County","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Alameda County Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#websites-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Websites \u0026 Web Apps","description":"Websites \u0026 Web Apps","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:28:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:36:00+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#websites-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Websites \u0026 Apps","description":"Websites \u0026 Apps","dateCr