opment and test environments in minutes instead of months. Bayer Crop Science provides agricultural products that support farmers and other customers throughout the world.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/BayerCropScience_Customer-Reference_Logo.5c397f30902a323a26d59af8d39d8196f059023b.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eBy running its geospatial data platform on AWS, Bayer Crop Science quickly scales to meet growth, provisions compute and storage in seconds, and sets up development and test environments in minutes instead of months. Bayer Crop Science provides agricultural products that support farmers and other customers throughout the world.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Agriculture","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/bayer-crop-science-EFS/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Monsanto","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Bayer Crop Science EFS Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#data-lakes","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Data Lakes","description":"Data Lakes","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T06:37:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#data-lakes-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Data Lakes \u0026 Analytics","description":"Data Lakes \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-07T13:55:55+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#efs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic File System (EFS)","description":"Amazon Elastic File System (EFS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#agriculture","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Agriculture","description":"Agriculture","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:02:53+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:00+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#sixgill","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"sixgill","dateCreated":"2020-03-26T20:48:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T22:36:24+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"By using AWS and ScaleArc to power its sensor ingestion services, Sixgill is able to analyze and process on average 3 TB of sensor data per day from 50 million devices. Sixgill uses ScaleArc load balancing software acquired from AWS Marketplace to scale their underlying SQL Server databases and handle underlying platform challenges, subsequently enabling Sixgill to ingest and analyze sensor data more efficiently and effectively.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/sixgill_logo@1x.6872e49397bfa923ae69eecdb481cdd545c9673d.png","displayLocation":"Israel","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/sixgill/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Sixgill increases system performance by hundreds of percent using ScaleArc and AWS Marketplace","customer-name":"Sixgill"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#middle-east-africa","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Middle East \u0026 Africa","description":"Middle East \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:53+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#marketplace","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Marketplace","description":"AWS Marketplace","dateCreated":"2020-12-02T20:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#marketplace","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Marketplace","description":"Marketplace","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-04-09T03:06:57+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#israel","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Israel","description":"Israel","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:55+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#middle-east","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Middle East","description":"Middle East","dateCreated":"2020-04-09T03:53:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:53+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#iot","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"IoT","description":"IoT","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#iot","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"IoT","description":"IoT","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#vancouver-international-airport-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"vancouver-international-airport-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T17:08:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:40:54+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Vancouver International Airport\u0027s (YVR) Innovative Travel Solutions team uses AWS to provide high availability and security for its BORDERXPRESS Automated Passport Control solution and to easily scale the solution to accommodate expansion to new airports. YVR, one of the world\u0027s busiest airports, is served by 55 airlines.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/VancouverInternationalAirport_Customer-Reference_Logo.09577ecd62f5b22bba93e16d285463604336b5da.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eVancouver International Airport?s (YVR) Innovative Travel Solutions team uses AWS to provide high availability and security for its BORDERXPRESS? Automated Passport Control solution and to easily scale the solution to accommodate expansion to new airports. YVR, one of the world?s busiest airports, is served by 55 airlines. The organization runs the solution on AWS, using multiple AWS Availability Zones for redundancy and taking advantage of AWS CloudFormation templates to refresh virtual servers and test images before sending them to production. ?We have virtually 24/7 uptime for our border-control solution in all the airports that we operate in across North America, because of the reliability we get using AWS.? - Linda Schucroft, Director, Innovative Travel Solutions, Vancouver International Airport\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Transport \u0026 Logistics","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/vancouver-international-airport/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Vancouver International Airport","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Vancouver International Airport Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#hospitality","locale":"en_U