lly for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#sequence-bio-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"sequence-bio-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T17:09:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:29+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Sequence Bio uses AWS to host its data platform it uses to analyze large amounts of genetic data. Sequence Bio is a Newfoundland and Labrador biotechnology company striving to improve how it treats diseases and develops medicine.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/SequenceBio_Customer-Reference_Logo.de10a0d258007ae91791e82297e94169498d9801.png","displayLocation":"Canada","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eSequence Bio uses AWS to host its data platform it uses to analyze large amounts of genetic data. Sequence Bio is a Newfoundland and Labrador biotechnology company striving to improve how it treats diseases and develops medicine. The company uses AWS to compute genetic data to help identify patterns across disease and genetic groups used in drug discovery.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Life Sciences","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/sequence-bio/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Sequence Bio","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Sequence Bio Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#content-delivery","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Content Delivery","description":"Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:38+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","nam