ter than ever and maintains security and compliance using AWS. OakNorth Bank was created to help the United Kingdom\u0027s growth businesses and entrepreneurs reach their potential by providing them with bespoke, no-nonsense debt-finance solutions.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/EMEA/Oaknorth%20logo2.ab8c2da6dc664bd034d28134e5a4a14d8b4f18cc.png","displayLocation":"United Kingdom","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eWatch the OakNorth customer video case study, powered by the AWS Cloud. AWS provides cloud computing services to hundreds of thousands of customers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/oaknorth/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"OakNorth","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: OakNorth"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#dev-and-test","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Dev \u0026 Test","description":"Dev \u0026 Test","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-17T20:28:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"202