 quickly while providing high levels of security for sensitive information and meeting compliance requirements. Cambia Health Solutions creates and invests in innovations designed to serve the changing needs of individuals and families, including a wide range of companies within its Direct Health Solutions Network.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/CambiaHealthSolutions_Customer-Reference_Logo.59453a0137f649f1b86e717b564c6e1574ee64c5.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"Cambia Health Solutions uses AWS to enable startup healthcare companies to get to scale quickly while providing high levels of security for sensitive information and meeting compliance requirements. ","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2016-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/cambia-health-solutions/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Cambia Health Solutions","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2016","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Cambia Health Solutions Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#website-hosting","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Website Hosting","description":"Website Hosting","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:07:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:36:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#general-public-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"General Public Services","description":"General Public Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:04+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#web-hosting","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Web Hosting","description":"Web Hosting","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-30T20:30:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#healthcare","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Healthcare","description":"Healthcare","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#caltech-guttman-lab-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"caltech-guttman-lab-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T19:49:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:35:33+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"The Guttman Lab at the California Institute of Technology uses an AWS-based high performance computing cluster to quickly add new compute nodes, analyze genomic sequencing data in days instead of weeks, and easily manage cluster access credentials. Led by Dr. Mitch Guttman, the Guttman Lab is a Pasadena, California-based research laboratory specializing in the study of large noncoding RNA genes.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/CaltechGuttmanLab_Customer-Reference_Logo.733e0fbf6658e39afb853c9da8170d3e1f0ef1af.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Guttman Lab at the California Institute of Technology uses an AWS-based high-performance computing (HPC) cluster to quickly add new compute nodes, analyze genomic sequencing data in days instead of weeks, and easily manage cluster access credentials.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Professional Services","sortDat